: Stage 1 standard library assertion verb for StageL 3.
ns std/assert.

: Traps deterministically when `cond` is false; returns `void` when `cond` is true.
: @dc l8589978237
pub v/void/assert b/cond
    test
        in true
        out.
        in false
        out fault.
    if b/cond do :: fault.
